{"title":"Titanium Arms","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 48) · Monster drop: Thak Footman, Thak Spearman, Virikh Templar, Thak Spearman, Thak Footman</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 40 · STR 100 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 48 <span class=\"muted\">(2341 XP)</span> from 3× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\">Titanium Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Footman - Normal, 0.4% of recorded drops (6 / 1,676 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7bd0bd081dd39324d454.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Footman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.4%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-spearman\" title=\"Thak Spearman - Normal, 0.5% of recorded drops (3 / 653 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4bb5ae8c7fe265fd4ca.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Spearman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.5%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh-templar\" title=\"Virikh Templar - Normal, 1.1% of recorded drops (1 / 87 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7c6325d168ea4e24bc71.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh Templar</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1.1%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"thak-spearman\" title=\"Thak Spearman - Elite, 12.5% of recorded drops (1 / 8 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4bb5ae8c7fe265fd4ca.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Spearman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">12.5%</span></div><butto